        </div>

      </div>

      <p class="avatar-caption">A little creative soul on the internet.</p>
    </div>


    <!-- RIGHT: INTRODUCTION -->
    <div class="intro-copy reveal">

      <span class="section-kicker">OH, HI THERE! ☁</span>

      <h2>
        I'm Fatima,<br />
        <span>your friendly</span><br />
